---@class strata.Choice
---@field chooser integer The player who answers.
---@field prompt string Text key shown to the chooser.
---@field figures? integer[] Pick one of these figures.
---@field spaces? strata.Space[] Pick one of these spaces.
---@field options? string[] Pick one of these labels; the answer is the label.
---@field yes_no? boolean Ask yes or no.
---@field number? { min: integer, max: integer } Pick a whole number.

